            <ArticleTitle>Cannabis body packing: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>327</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.11604/pamj.2016.24.327.9450</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Drug traffic is a major concern worldwide. We report a case of a 27-year old male who presented with a diffuse abdominal plain to the emergency department. Abdominal X-ray demonstrated multiple foreign bodies along the intestinal tract, which were found to be cannabis packets. The patient was treated conservatively with a good result.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
